  "body": "Updated to Vim 9.1.2068\n\nThis is a pre-release version of MacVim. To use the latest stable release, see <https://github.com/macvim-dev/macvim/releases/latest>\n\n<details><summary>What's Changed</summary>\n\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at prerelease-182.1 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* Whats New page use non-persistent data store by @ychin in https://github.com/macvim-dev/macvim/pull/1619\n* Build MacVim binary release with GNU iconv instead of Apple iconv by @ychin in https://github.com/macvim-dev/macvim/pull/1626\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/macvim-dev/macvim/compare/release-182...prerelease-182.1\n\n</details>\n",
